      "stem": "Layer 1: What are Floating Point Operations Per Second (FLOPS) in AI computing?",
      "figure": "<div class=\"fl-diagram\"><span class=\"fl-eyebrow\">01 · everyday meaning</span><h3>A processor completes a stream of arithmetic calculations</h3><div class=\"fl-canvas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A factory-like arithmetic pipeline of decimal operations flowing toward a speedometer labeled FLOP per second\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs><linearGradient id=\"q1glow\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#ddf6f1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#e5f1fb\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n<rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#fffdf9\" stroke=\"#d9e6ed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"48\" y=\"73\" fill=\"#577a8f\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">FLOATING-POINT CALCULATIONS</text>\n<rect x=\"50\" y=\"92\" width=\"210\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e7f6f4\" stroke=\"#c3e5df\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"114\" fill=\"#24646b\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\">2.5 × 4.0</text><text x=\"281\" y=\"114\" fill=\"#1d7f71\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">→ 10.0</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"133\" width=\"210\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e7f6f4\" stroke=\"#c3e5df\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#24646b\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\">1.2 + 3.8</text><text x=\"281\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#1d7f71\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">→ 5.0</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"174\" width=\"210\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e7f6f4\" stroke=\"#c3e5df\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#24646b\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\">8.0 ÷ 2.0</text><text x=\"281\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#1d7f71\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">→ 4.0</text>\n<path d=\"M455 135H515m-10-10 10 10-10 10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d78b54\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<rect x=\"531\" y=\"42\" width=\"340\" height=\"188\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e6ed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"636\" cy=\"133\" r=\"62\" fill=\"#e9f4fa\" stroke=\"#b5d6e6\" stroke-width=\"7\"/>\n<path d=\"M593 165a55 55 0 1 1 86 0\" stroke=\"#3c9db7\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M636 134l31-32\" stroke=\"#d47d4b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"636\" cy=\"134\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#d47d4b\"/>\n<text x=\"724\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#688093\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">RATE</text><text x=\"724\" y=\"138\" fill=\"#245b7a\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\">FLOP/s</text><text x=\"724\" y=\"162\" fill=\"#5a7888\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"start\">per second</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"259\" fill=\"#658293\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Illustration: operations completed over time, not a benchmark result</text>\n</svg></div><p class=\"fl-note\"><strong>Floating point</strong> is a way computers represent numbers with fractions or very large/small values. FLOPS is the rate of such arithmetic operations.</p></div>",
