      "figure": "<div class=\"fl-diagram\"><span class=\"fl-eyebrow\">02 · why the metric matters</span><h3>Two machines face the same workload; completion time reveals delivered speed</h3><div class=\"fl-canvas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 292\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two hardware lanes show device A completes one billion floating point operations in point one second for ten GFLOPs per second while device B takes point two seconds for five GFLOPs per second\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"31\" fill=\"#476981\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">WORKLOAD: 1 billion floating-point operations</text>\n<rect x=\"37\" y=\"76\" width=\"826\" height=\"77\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e6ed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#3a5d74\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">DEVICE A</text><rect x=\"197\" y=\"90\" width=\"560\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#edf2f4\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"197\" y=\"90\" width=\"510\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#3896a2\"/><text x=\"767\" y=\"106\" fill=\"#3a5d74\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\">0.10 s</text><text x=\"198\" y=\"134\" fill=\"#537f91\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\">10 GFLOP/s measured</text><rect x=\"37\" y=\"172\" width=\"826\" height=\"77\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e6ed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"201\" fill=\"#3a5d74\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\">DEVICE B</text><rect x=\"197\" y=\"186\" width=\"560\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#edf2f4\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"197\" y=\"186\" width=\"255\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#d89664\"/><text x=\"767\" y=\"202\" fill=\"#3a5d74\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\">0.20 s</text><text x=\"198\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#537f91\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\">5 GFLOP/s measured</text>\n<text x=\"449\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#5d798b\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Measured performance depends on the workload, not only the chip's advertised peak.</text>\n</svg></div><p class=\"fl-note\"><strong>Use FLOP/s to compare delivered arithmetic throughput</strong> for a defined workload and precision. It is not a standalone guarantee of low latency, model quality, or power efficiency.</p></div>",
